Cell["\<\
Expected independent benchmark: the generalised Ricci scalar is zero and the \
generalised Kretschmann scalar is 192 mBH^2/r^6. At r=2 mBH the latter is \
3/mBH^4. These expressions are not inserted into the curvature engine.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"969a4dbb-fe13-1540-930e-b4e5f6ee3b5c"],

