Cell["\<\
Expected independent benchmark: the generalised Ricci scalar is zero and the \
generalised Kretschmann scalar is 192 mBH^2/r^6 - 384 mBH qCharge^2/r^7 + 224 \
qCharge^4/r^8. At the positive root this is 20480 mBH^8/qCharge^12.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ca23813e-a34a-554e-863d-2a9731aa5d75"],

