Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4. Compare frames and retain results", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d097c4b4-c6fc-c248-ba5c-6ede9cf329e6"],

Cell["\<\
Original, DualPreferred and DualRegular contain the generic-f(r) data. Their \
Specialised counterparts contain the selected explicit function. The ordinary \
dual metric and b-field are stored in DualPreferred. The regular association \
deliberately contains frame data only; it does not relabel ordinary \
coordinate data as regular-frame tensors.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"50e0b9d4-299d-3d4e-8787-99d2b4196cd0"],

